---
import Logo from "./Logo.astro";
import site from "../data/site.json";
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="牧之安首页">
          <Logo variant="primary" tone="cream" class="footer-logo" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
        <p>以策略与审美，为品牌、内容与空间，找到恰当的位置。</p>
      </div>

      <nav class="footer-col" aria-label="页脚导航">
        <h3>导航</h3>
        <a href="/work/">案例</a>
        <a href="/services/">服务</a>
        <a href="/services/software/">软件与工具</a>
        <a href="/studio/">关于</a>
        <a href="/contact/">联系</a>
      </nav>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h3>联系</h3>
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
        <a href="/company/">公司信息</a>
        <a href="/privacy/">隐私政策</a>
        <a href="/services/software/dingding/">丁丁看图</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-legal">
      <div class="footer-legal-group">
        <span>© <span data-year>2026</span> 牧之安（上海）文化创意有限公司</span>
        <span>统一社会信用代码 91310114MAEBHDQM6J</span>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-legal-group">
        <span>ICP 备案办理中</span>
        <span>上海 · 嘉定</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
